      working: 'Working',
      turn: 'Your turn',
      tasks: ['Refactor the sign-in flow', 'Release notes for 0.4', 'Nightly data import'],
      caption: 'One server, a home per person. Chen closed the browser; the agent did not stop.',
    },
    sameWork:
      'The conversation is Pi’s own session in your home directory, so the files, Git repositories and history are the ones you would find over SSH. Open Habitat adds a browser, not a second place where your work lives.',
